      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process, immediately before that process starts**. \n\nThe key detail is that the Hub process itself never holds the key \u2014 a local secrets loader reads it from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it directly into the child process\u0027s environment only when the child process is being spawned. This way, the Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated, which prevents a compromised Hub from leaking the credential by inspecting its own environment variables.\n\nThe same pattern applies to the Query agent as well: it receives the credential the same way, injected into its own environment at spawn time.",
